# Emulator param values (demo-homehub). Empty = identity layer dormant.
# Without this file the emulator PROMPTS interactively for every defineString
# param and hangs headless runs.
#
# NOTE: BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY is deliberately NOT here — it's a defineSecret
# (see chatQuery / searchProductImages / productLookup), so it comes from Secret
# Manager in prod and from firebase/functions/.secret.local in the emulator.
ICECAT_USERNAME=
